{"step_index":973,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T03:00:51Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T22:00:51-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T22:00:51-05:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/gta%206%20mission%20workflow%20charts/gta6_mission_flow_chart.md`\nTotal Lines: 401\nTotal Bytes: 27080\nShowing lines 1 to 150\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # Grand Theft Auto VI: Campaign Mission Flow & Prerequisite Guide\n2: \n3: This document provides the definitive mission dependency graph, prerequisite unlock trees, character-switching milestones, heist setup pipelines, points of no return, and speedrun routing across all 5 story chapters of *Grand Theft Auto VI*.\n4: \n5: ---\n6: \n7: ## 1. High-Level Campaign Architecture\n8: \n9: The GTA VI storyline progresses through five distinct geographical and thematic narrative blocks. While open-world exploration is available between operations, missions operate in a strict Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) with key narrative bottlenecks connecting each chapter.\n10: \n11: ```mermaid\n12: flowchart TD\n13:     subgraph C1B[\"Prologue & Chapter 1\"]\n14:         C1[\"Just Like Paradise<br/>(Leonida Keys & Key Lento)<br/>Missions 1 - 18\"]\n15:     end\n16: \n17:     subgraph C2B[\"Chapter 2\"]\n18:         C2[\"Paradise Lost<br/>(Port Gellhorn & Kelly County)<br/>Missions 23 - 44\"]\n19:     end\n20: \n21:     subgraph C3B[\"Chapter 3\"]\n22:         C3[\"Vice City Syndicate Expansion<br/>(Vice City Metro & Sinfrontera Heist)<br/>Missions 45 - 70\"]\n23:     end\n24: \n25:     subgraph C4B[\"Chapter 4\"]\n26:         C4[\"Vice City Metro & Airport Takedown<br/>(Ocean Beach & VCIA Cargo Heist)<br/>Missions 71 - 95\"]\n27:     end\n28: \n29:     subgraph C5B[\"Chapter 5\"]\n30:         C5[\"Top of the World, Ma!<br/>(Climax, Standoff & Branching Endings)<br/>Missions 96 - 102\"]\n31:     end\n32: \n33:     C1 -->|\"Bottleneck: Doin' Gone\"| C2\n34:     C2 -->|\"Bottleneck: Checking Out\"| C3\n35:   \n<truncated 5376 bytes>\n**: Vehicle recovery, Kelly County smugglers, and the motel evacuation climax in *Checking Out*.\n115: \n116: ```mermaid\n117: flowchart TD\n118:     C1_Trans[\"From Ch. 1: Doin' Gone\"] --> S1_Start\n119:     \n120:     subgraph S1[\"Stage 1: Motel Arrival & Fencing (M23 - M28)\"]\n121:         S1_Start[\"23. What's in the Bag?<br/>(Starlet Motel Arrival)\"] --> M24[\"24. Overnight Charges\"]\n122:         M24 --> M25[\"25. Take Care of Jason<br/>(Lucia Solo Medical Run)\"]\n123:         M25 --> M26[\"26. Just Moved In\"]\n124:         M26 --> M27[\"27. Girls' Trip\"]\n125:         M27 --> M28[\"28. Moses<br/>(Vehicle Fencing Unlocked)\"]\n126:     end\n127:     \n128:     M28 -->|\"Stage 1 Complete\"| S2_Start\n129:     \n130:     subgraph S2[\"Stage 2: Debt Hustle & Gun Runs (M29 - M37)\"]\n131:         S2_Start[\"29. New Look -> 30. How Do I Look?\"] --> M31[\"31. Behind on Payments\"]\n132:         M31 --> M32[\"32. Ambulance Chaser\"]\n133:         M32 --> M33[\"33. Painkiller Supplier\"]\n134:         M33 --> M34[\"34. Daily Driver -> 35. Pick Up A Gun\"]\n135:         M34 --> M36[\"36. Slam Dunk -> 37. Breakfast Run\"]\n136:     end\n137:     \n138:     M36 -->|\"Stage 2 Complete\"| S3_Start\n139:     \n140:     subgraph S3[\"Stage 3: Dual Character Switching (M38 - M40)\"]\n141:         S3_Start[\"38. Coffee Break<br/>★ DUAL CHARACTER SWITCHING UNLOCKED ★\"] --> M39[\"39. Hit Avery Pawn<br/>(Robbery Mechanic Active)\"]\n142:         M39 --> M40[\"40. Hit Kingpin Bowling<br/>(Optional / Skip in Any%)\"]\n143:     end\n144:     \n145:     M40 -->|\"Stage 3 Complete\"| S4_Start\n146:     \n147:     subgraph S4[\"Stage 4: Highway Escape & Move to VC (M41 - M44)\"]\n148:         S4_Start[\"41. Impounded Vehicle\"] --> M42[\"42. Afternoon Delight\"]\n149:         M42 --> M43[\"43. Prepare for Vice City\"]\n150:         M43 --> M44[\"44. Checking Out<br/>★ CHAPTER 2 CLIMAX ★<br/>(Port Gellhorn Evacuation)\"]\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
