{"step_index":975,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T03:00:53Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T22:00:53-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T22:00:54-05:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/gta%206%20mission%20workflow%20charts/gta6_mission_flow_chart.md`\nTotal Lines: 401\nTotal Bytes: 27080\nShowing lines 151 to 401\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n151:     end\n152:     \n153:     M44 -->|\"Hard Transition\"| C3_Start[\"→ Chapter 3: Welcome to Vice City\"]\n154: ```\n155: \n156: ---\n157: \n158: ## 4. Chapter 3: Vice City Syndicate Expansion & Bank Heist\n159: \n160: ### Mechanics & Structure\n161: - **Scope**: 26 main story operations (M45 through M70).\n162: - **Safehouse Spine (M45–M50)**: Infiltration into the metropolis culminates in *South Leonida Real Estate*, opening the primary Vice City safehouse.\n163: - **The 3 Parallel Alliance Strands**: Upon unlocking the safehouse, three major syndicate storylines open concurrently:\n164:   1. **Strand 1: Tyrone (Street Muscle)**: Missions 51 & 52 (*Tyrone* $\\rightarrow$ *Here, Kitty Kitty*).\n165:   2. **Strand 2: Boobie Ike & Dre'Quan (Syndicate)**: Missions 54, 55, & 56 (*Top Billing* $\\rightarrow$ *Boobie Time* $\\rightarrow$ *First Impressions*).\n166:   3. **Strand 3: Raul Bautista & Randy (Cartel Logistics & Cars)**: Missions 53, 57, 58, 59, & 60 (*Car Service* $\\rightarrow$ *Caught Slipping* $\\rightarrow$ *Crosstown Traffic* $\\rightarrow$ *Credit Check* $\\rightarrow$ *Steal Zorrusso for Randy*).\n167: - **Convergence at Heist Scope Out (M61)**: All 3 strands converge into *Sinfrontera National Bank*.\n168: - **The 3 Concurrent Heist Preparation Tracks**: Scope out unlocks the heist planning board, distributing prep work into 3 simultaneous tracks:\n169:   - **Track 1: Safecracker Pipeline**: *62. Security Expert* (Nicole Park) $\\rightarrow$ *65. Safe Word* (Drill) $\\rightarrow$ *68. Cooties* (Disinfection).\n170:   - **Track 2: Explosiv\n<truncated 16764 bytes>\nding A (*Bonnie & Clyde*) requires $2,000,000 in the player's bank account to unlock.\n390: - **Fact**: Script analysis confirms that **$2,000,000 is the mission completion cash reward** paid out to Jason and Lucia upon successfully surviving the Coast Guard gauntlet, NOT an entry prerequisite. Players do not need to grind money before initiating the finale.\n391: \n392: ### 3. Strict Sequential Progression vs. Concurrent Parallel Strands\n393: - **Chapters 2 & 4 (Sequential Stages)**: Visual \"wrap-around\" diagonal arrows in older community flowcharts made Chapters 2 and 4 look like parallel faction branches. In reality, they are strict chronological stages (Stages 1 through 4) where each phase must be fully cleared before the next stage opens.\n394: - **Chapter 3 (True Parallel Faction Strands)**: Once the Vice City safehouse is unlocked in Mission 50, Tyrone (Strand 1), Boobie (S